      "**Rural Development Programs:** Schemes like PMAY (housing), PMGSY (rural roads), and Swachh Bharat implement Article 38's welfare mandate.",
      "**Affirmative Action:** Reservation policies address group-based inequalities as directed by Article 38(2).",
