      "**Coal/Bank Nationalization:** Distribution of material resources for common good — Article 39(b).",
      "**Competition Act, 2002:** Prevents concentration of economic power — Article 39(c).",
      "**Equal Remuneration Act, 1976:** Mandates equal pay for equal work — Article 39(d).",
      "**Factories Act Worker Protections:** Health and safety provisions implement Article 39(e).",
      "**Juvenile Justice Act:** Protects children's development and dignity — Article 39(f).",
      "**POCSO Act, 2012:** Protects children from sexual offences — Article 39(f).",
      "**Land Reform Laws:** Redistribute agricultural land — Articles 39(b) and (c).",
      "**Public Distribution System:** Distributes food resources for common good — Article 39(b).",
      "**Maternity Benefit Act, 2017:** Protects working women's health — Article 39(e).",
